			<Comment Bounds="530 465 445 122" Id="112" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"Shut down VI:\n\n1. Unregister for  ActiveX/COM Events.\n2. Unregister for LabVIEW Events.\n3. Destroy LabVIEW Events.\n4 Resize controls to edit time sizes.\n5. Close references and clear globals\n6. Close panel if it started closed. Also reset panel title for localization.\n7. Close reference to top-level VI. THIS MUST REMAIN THE VERY LAST STEP"</p.Text>
			</Comment>
